  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span>대완<ruby>웨<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ECYgFdtGDco?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>제<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>社會<rt>샤훼ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jè si-siâ̰-mîh sia-huē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>𨑨<rt>칟ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>迌<rt>토ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>比<rt>비ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>拍拚<rt>팧ˆ뱔</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>錢<rt>질ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>較<rt>캏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby><span style=\"font-family: Noto Sans SC\">㩼</span><rt>죄ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chît-thó’e pî-phâh-pia̰’e jḭ́ khâh-joē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>大街小巷<rt>돠괴ˉ쇼ˆ항ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>買<rt>뾔ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一本<rt>짇분ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>冊<rt>쳏</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    toa-koē-siô-hāng boê-bó jit-pûn-cheh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>電動<rt>뎬덩ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>퓨<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>퓨<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>開<rt>퀴ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>徦<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>規<rt>귀ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>四界<rt>시ˋ괴</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tien-tōng’e phiû-phiù khūi-kâh-kūi-sì-koe\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>若<rt>나-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>逐家<rt>닥게ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì na-ē bêh-e-tak-kê ē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>巧<rt>ᄏᆤˋ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>算<rt>승ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一个<rt>짇에ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khiàu’e goà ma-sǹg-jit-é\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>台灣話<rt>대완웨ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tai-oan-wē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>若<rt>나-</rt></ruby><ruby>想欲<rt>슐뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>靠<rt>코ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>贏筊<rt>얄ᄀᆤˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>賰<rt>춘ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>家賄<rt>게ˉ훼ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kông-na-siṵ-bêh-khò-ya̰-kiàu chūn-kē-huè\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>到尾仔<rt>ᄀᅷˋ쀄ˆ아ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>賣<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>𡚸<rt>뻐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>賣<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>囝<rt>걀ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>賣<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>老爸<rt>ᄅᅷ베ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kàu-buê-à boe-bòr boe-kià̰ boe-lau-pē\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>제<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>社會<rt>샤훼ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jè si-siâ̰-mîh sia-huē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>做官<rt>죄ˋ괄ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>本錢<rt>분ˆ질ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>開<rt>캐ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"hiâh\">遐<rt>햫ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby><span style=\"font-family: Noto Sans SC\">㩼</span><rt>죄ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    joè-koâ̰’e pûn-jḭ́ tio-khāi-hiâh-joē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>大大<rt>돠돠-</rt></ruby><ruby>細細<rt>쇠ˋ쇠</rt></ruby> <ruby>買票<rt>뾔ˆ표</rt></ruby> <ruby>兼<rt>걈ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>烏紗<rt>어ˉ세ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    toa-toa-soè-soe boê-phio kiām-ōr-sê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>當選<rt>덩ˋ솬ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>換<rt>왈-</rt></ruby><ruby>이<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby> <ruby>挨<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>란<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>老百姓<rt>ᄅᅷ벻ˆ셀</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tòng-soàn tio-oa̰-ī e-lân-lau-pêh-sḛ\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>若<rt>나-</rt></ruby><ruby>買<rt>뾔ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>欲<rt>뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>買<rt>뾔ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>逐家<rt>닥게ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>買<rt>뾔ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì na-boè bêh-boè tak-kê boè\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>痟貪<rt>ᄉᆤˆ탐ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>算<rt>승ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一个<rt>짇에ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siâu-thâm’e goà ma-sǹg-jit-é\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>台灣話<rt>대완웨ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tai-oan-wē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>若<rt>나-</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>做<rt>죄ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>大人<rt>대띤ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>用<rt>영-</rt></ruby><ruby>錢<rt>질-</rt></ruby><ruby>買<rt>뾔ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kông-na-u-láng joè-tai-rín yong-jḭ-boè\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>到<rt>ᄀᅷˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>尾仔<rt>쀄ˆ아ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>衰<rt>쉐ˆ</rt></ruby>’릐 <ruby>衰<rt>쉐ˆ</rt></ruby>’꽈 <ruby>衰<rt>쉐ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>逐家<rt>닥게ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kàu-buê-à suê’li suê’goa suē-tak-kê\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>제<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥物<rt>샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>社會<rt>샤훼ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jè si-siâ̰-mîh sia-huē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>目睭<rt>빡쥬ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>懸<rt>괠ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>低<rt>게ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bak-jiû lông-khoà̰-koá̰i bo-khoà̰-kē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>大人<rt>돠랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>只<rt>지ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>간<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>나<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>顧<rt>거</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby>面底皮<rt>삔되ˆ풰ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    toa-láng jî-kân-nā-kor’tio bin-toê-phué\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>比<rt>비ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>姼仔<rt>칟ˆ아ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>比<rt>비ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>車<rt>챠ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>比<rt>비ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>厝<rt>추</rt></ruby> <ruby>比<rt>비ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>露螺<rt>러레ˊ</rt></ruby><a href=\"#_ftn1\" id=\"_ftnref1\"><strong>¹</strong></a>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    pî-chît-à pî-chiâ pî-chu pî-lor-lé\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>若<rt>나-</rt></ruby><ruby>吹<rt>췌ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>要<rt>ᄋᆤˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>吹<rt>췌ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>大家<rt>다ˋ쟈ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>吹<rt>췌ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì na-chuê yàu-chuê tà-jiâ chuê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>膨風<rt>펑ˋ헝ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嘛<rt>마-</rt></ruby><ruby>算<rt>승ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一个<rt>짇에ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    phòng-hông’e goà ma-sǹg-jit-é\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>台灣話<rt>대완웨ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tai-oan-wē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>做人<rt>죄ˋ랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>照起工<rt>ᄌᆤˋ키ˆ강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>跤踏實地<rt>카ˉ닿싣데ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kông-joè-láng bo-jiàu-khî-kâng khā-tah-sit-tē\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>到<rt>ᄀᅷˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>尾仔<rt>쀄ˆ아ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>悽慘<rt>치ˉ참ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>落魄<rt>럭폑</rt></ruby> <ruby>徦<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>狼狽<rt>령붸ˉ</rt></ruby>’엏\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kàu-buê-à chī-chàm lork-phiek kâh-liong-puē’orh\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<table class=\"wp-block-table alignleft\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse;border: none;font-size: 16px\">\n  <tbody><tr>\n    <td style=\"border: none;vertical-align: top;min-width: 5em;padding-right: 1.5em;padding-left: 0;padding-top: 0;padding-bottom: 0\">\n  <a href=\"#_ftnref1\" id=\"_ftn1\">¹</a>\n  <i>\n    <span><ruby title=\"lor-lé\">露螺<rt>러레ˊ</rt></ruby></span>\n  </i> :\n</td>\n    <td style=\"border: none;padding: 0\">\n      (中) 勞力士。<br>\n      (en) Rolex.\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n\n<div style=\"clear: both;margin-bottom: 1em\"></div>\n"
}
